{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43279","headline":"秋霁望庐山瀑布 · 夏侯楚","name":"秋霁望庐山瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思瀑布幽，晴晀喜逢秋。\n一带连青嶂，千寻倒碧流。\n湿云应悞鹤，飜浪定惊鸥。\n星浦虹初下，炉峰烟未收。\n岩高时褭褭，天净起悠悠。\n傥见朝宗日，还须济巨舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"夏侯楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}